# polyskills — Cline Adapter

## Skill Routing

1. Load `skills/INDEX.md` first — one line per skill, lightweight
2. Match the user's request against the Trigger column
3. Load `skills/<matched>/SKILL.md` fully and follow its Process steps
4. Apply referenced `common-skills/` patterns

## Agent Routing

Cline spawns sub-agents inline via `use_subagents`. Available workers:

| Agent | When to use |
|-------|------------|
| researcher | deep research in parallel, evidence gathering |
| critic | adversarial review of a plan or doc |
| sme | "SME [domain]" — validate domain assumption |
| scout | idea triage before committing to a repo |
| distiller | extract structure from transcripts/notes/drafts |

Brief each sub-agent with: task, context summary, output format, constraints.
Do NOT pass the full conversation — summarize what it needs.

## Key Rule

Load `skills/INDEX.md` first. Never load all SKILL.md files speculatively.
